@startuml
title Goals Program

class Program {
    + Main() : void
    + DisplayMenu(): void
}

note right of Program
    The Program class is the entry point for the 
    program and displays the menu and takes the
    input from the user to initiate 
    the goal that the user wants to input.
end note

class Goal {

    - _name : string
    - _description : string

    + GetGoalName() : string
    + GetDescription() : string
    + GetPoints() : int
    + RecordEvent() : int
    + IsCompleted() : bool
    + DisplayGoal() : string
}

note right of Goal
    The base class for all goal types.
    it defines shared behavior among
    all the classes
end note

class OneTimeGoals {
    - _isComplete : bool

    + RecordEvent() : int
    + IsCompleted() : bool
    + DisplayGoal() : string

}

note right of OneTimeGoals
    OneTimeGoals inherits from Goal.
end note

class EternalGoal {
    + RecordEvent() : int
    + IsCompleted() : bool
    + DisplayGoal() : string

}

note right of EternalGoal
    EternalGoal inherits from Goal.
end note

class ChecklistGoal {

    - _targetCount : int
    - _currentCount : int
    - _bonusPoints : int

    + RecordEvent() : int
    + IsCompleted() : bool
    + DisplayGoal() : string
    
}

note right of ChecklistGoal
    ChecklistGoal inherits from Goal.
end note

class GoalHub {
    - _goals : List<Goal>
    - _score : int

    + AddGoal(Goal) : void
    + RecordGoalEvent(int) : void
    + DisplayGoals() : void
    + DisplayScore() : void
    + SaveGoals(string) : void
    + LoadGoals(string) : void

}

Program --> GoalHub
GoalHub "1" *-- "*" Goal
Goal <|-- OneTimeGoals
Goal <|-- EternalGoal
Goal <|-- ChecklistGoal




@enduml